{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：22:10 2026-08-23 HKT</p>\n\n<p>TVB王牌音樂節目《中年好聲音4》總決賽《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》今晚（23日）假啟德體藝館隆重舉行，七強先後出場唱出「決勝慢歌」，之後唱出「決勝快歌」尹景順就演繹張國榮的〈大熱〉，他滿身肌肉作出跳唱，讓他奪得94分，成為快歌MVP，評審李克勤就指他開頭有點拘謹，但後面被Dancers「摸摸吓就慣」，最終表現極佳，李克勤亦指「鍾意佢嘅表現」。尹景順亦憑一流表現，贏得「快歌MVP」和「觀眾最愛好聲音」兩個大獎。</p>\n<h2>鄭家聲壓吳亦偉入三強</h2>\n<p>其中於「決勝慢歌」有失誤的尤淑情，即時重拾信心唱出〈Bad Boy〉，引來周國豐、張佳添、海兒拍掌叫好，但因為早前失分太多而未能助她殺入三強。鄭家聲於快歌部份唱出〈鐵幕誘惑〉，被海兒盛讚「Rock爆舞台」，令他搶回不少分數，最後因為得到極高觀眾投票分數，成功壓倒兩回合計同分的吳亦偉和蔡宓婕，成功殺入三強。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a55d64cfbe5b15f77093f9de833426c/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791493_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/339bebe2cb70bf03e1756791690d1fc1/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791493_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/557d6c435657d522d6bda633192700b9/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791495_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b463751364048033f49b1994ecab300/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791502_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a5c0926dce5af50240633dbfd7f01b2/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791507_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc7868d5fb60d5131f654f6598f3bf0d/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791515_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5db003d8c9ede218dbb8993882b853b5/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791515_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/443d86f67ae2c140251d1b460374eb25/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791518_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5134048a2aaed5607abf33f979706a5/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791520_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9120949114140482980693cb0e5813b9/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791521_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03298edabdc1151ba3d1608971749308/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791530_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bd75fbb4415363a7daa0f80ea14fd7c/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791530_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc3bd709676e36647f7a746b4e42495f/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791530_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28ae8e06efff644e94679f1f6cf139fe/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791531_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27ca915eaee1aba87c50342821f4520c/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791531_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23e012b5e8cc2ae1bf14e72d21490434/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791531_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13268a98ac42421f4b032491728abcd6/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791552_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/761439cff45ccc1f4d5417bc9f8cc67a/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791552_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1500521fa40bc63aab96d9530aeeb933/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791554_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46d44ae7029c2e04e2b0705c66d51134/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791554_45_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>許雲妮〈I Will Survive〉表現出色</h2>\n<p>而於慢歌取得高分的許雲妮，於快歌演唱〈I Will Survive〉，雖然被巫啟賢於前段演出較緊，而令整首歌未能有大對比，但她仍取得足夠分數殺入三強，跟尹景順和鄭家聲爭冠。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T14:31:33.492040+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":507,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}